# The kernel is multi-threaded WebAssembly on SharedArrayBuffer, which browsers
# only enable in a cross-origin isolated page. Every response needs these three.
# (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify syntax; on another server set the same headers
# and serve *.wasm as application/wasm - compileStreaming rejects other types.)
/*
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin

# Same name is reused across rebuilds, so revalidate instead of caching forever.
/static/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
